#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:16
msgid "build a new list from an old one in one line, with a **list comprehension** - the Python version of SQL `SELECT expression ... WHERE condition`;"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:18
msgid "sum and count with a condition without building a list, with a **generator expression** - and see why it saves memory;"
