msgid "1. More list methods"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:52
msgid "[Session 3](./03-lists-tuples-sets.md#_6-the-methods-of-a-list) has the table of all list methods. In class we used `append` and `extend`. Here are the others you need most: remove items, find an item, sort."
msgstr ""

#. heading 3
#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:56
msgid "Remove items: `remove`, `pop`, `del`"
msgstr ""

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:74
msgid "You know"
msgstr ""

#. table cell
